1191
01:00:08,367 --> 01:00:15,563
I think this water bottle is actually quite important.

1192
01:00:15,587 --> 01:00:21,480
Like my classmates, they're all societal trash, smokers.

1193
01:00:21,621 --> 01:00:23,825
All these people.

1194
01:00:23,837 --> 01:00:27,784
But later, they became elementary school teachers,

1195
01:00:27,865 --> 01:00:33,847
